      "text": "men have strayed from the Lord’s ordinances, D&C 1:15. the Lord accepts those who obey his ordinances, D&C 52:15–16. Joseph Smith given keys of mysteries if he obeys ordinances, D&C 64:5. John’s little book was mission and ordinance to gather Israel, D&C 77:14 (Rev. 10:2, 9–10). in ordinances of Melchizedek Priesthood is power of godliness manifest, D&C 84:20–21. ordinance of washing of feet instituted to receive men into School of Prophets, D&C 88:139–40. Aaronic Priesthood to administer outward ordinances, D&C 107:14, 20. persecutors of Saints to be severed from ordinances of the Lord’s house, D&C 121:19. build house wherein ordinance of baptizing for dead belongs, D&C 124:33. the Lord will reveal ordinances in his house, D&C 124:38–40. nature of ordinance of baptism for dead consists in binding power of priesthood, D&C 128:8. Saints to covenant that they will walk in all the Lord’s ordinances, D&C 136:4. great latter-day work to include temple ordinances, D&C 138:54. repentant dead redeemed through obedience to temple ordinances, D&C 138:58.",
